# The passivation step of a Bosch process (soidlc.plasma, the C4F8 half of BoschProcess) in the planar-coil ICP reactor of
# bosch_etch.ferma: c-C4F8 on the coil's RF power, no bias, solved by Ferma's global model (ferma_icp): the gas chemistry of
# the built-in mechanism "c4f8" and the transport of the neutrals to the 150 mm wafer, whose CFx fluxes deposit the
# fluorocarbon film. soidlc overrides the parameters with -p (ferma build -p P_rf=600W ...).
param R      = 10 cm                      # chamber radius
param H      = 8 cm                       # chamber height
param t_win  = 1.5 cm                     # window thickness
param gap    = 3 mm                       # window to coil turns
param w      = 6 mm                       # turn cross-section
param P_rf   = 600 W in 50 W .. 5 kW      # coil (generator) power
param p      = 30 mTorr in 5 mTorr .. 200 mTorr
param q_c4f8 = 100 sccm in 5 sccm .. 1 slm
let   zc     = H + t_win + gap + w/2

domain icp    = axisymmetric(r: R, z: 14 cm)
region plasma = rect(size: [R, H], center: [R/2, H/2])
region window = rect(size: [R, t_win], center: [R/2, H + t_win/2])
region coil1  = rect(size: [w, w], center: [1.9 cm, zc])
region coil2  = rect(size: [w, w], center: [3.9 cm, zc])
region coil3  = rect(size: [w, w], center: [5.9 cm, zc])
region coil4  = rect(size: [w, w], center: [7.9 cm, zc])

mesh base   = settings(size: 1.5 mm, order: 1)
mesh turns1 = refine(on: coil1, size: 0.5 mm)
mesh turns2 = refine(on: coil2, size: 0.5 mm)
mesh turns3 = refine(on: coil3, size: 0.5 mm)
mesh turns4 = refine(on: coil4, size: 0.5 mm)

material dep = gas(name: "c4f8", pressure: p, temperature: 315 K, feed: [flow("C4F8", q_c4f8)])
load     rf  = coil(on: [coil1, coil2, coil3, coil4], power: P_rf, resistance: 0.5 ohm)
analysis run = discharge(on: plasma, gas: dep, model: "global", wafer_diameter: 150 mm)
